{
    "title": "FC Barcelona Official App",
    "description": "No matter where you are in the world, FC Barcelona's official app is the perfect partner for loyal Culers like you. Download for free and access all these benefits:\r\n\r\nMATCH DAY LIVE COVERAGE\r\nAccess the app on match days and see live statistics and results, exclusive content from the club, breaking news, coach's press conferences, and much more.\r\n\r\nEXCLUSIVE CLIPS YOU WILL ONLY FIND HERE\r\nGoals, top action, behind-the-scenes video, classic videos, unique footage of our players... Experience Bar\u00e7a like never before in short vertical videos!\r\n\r\nSTAY UP-TO-DATE WITH BAR\u00c7A STORIES\r\nKeeping up to date at Bar\u00e7a has never been so easy. Follow Bar\u00e7a\u2019s day-to-day in real-time and dynamic Stories.\r\n\r\nBE THE FIRST TO RECEIVE OFFICIAL NEWS\r\nEverything is just gossip until you receive our official news. Make sure to turn push notifications on and you\u2019ll always be the most up-to-date person in the room.\r\n\r\nSHARE YOUR OPINION WITH CULERS AROUND THE WORLD\r\nWho has been the man of the match? Who do you think should start in the next game? Have your say and check out official club polls to see what other fans think.\r\n\r\nTEST YOUR BAR\u00c7A KNOWLEDGE AND CHALLENGE FRIENDS\r\nDo you think you know everything about Bar\u00e7a? Take part in our daily quizzes and prove you're the ultimate fan!\r\n\r\nCOMPETE AGAINST OTHER FANS\r\nShow off your Bar\u00e7a expertise and climb to the top of the Match Day Challenge leaderboard by predicting the score, rating the game, and acing the match quizzes.\r\n\r\nPREPARE YOURSELF FOR A VISIT\r\nWhether it's tickets for the next match, a museum pass, or the latest kit you're after, you\u2019ll find it all in the online shop.\r\n\r\nFor\u00e7a Bar\u00e7a!",
    "descriptionHTML": "No matter where you are in the world, FC Barcelona&#39;s official app is the perfect partner for loyal Culers like you. Download for free and access all these benefits:<br><br>MATCH DAY LIVE COVERAGE<br>Access the app on match days and see live statistics and results, exclusive content from the club, breaking news, coach&#39;s press conferences, and much more.<br><br>EXCLUSIVE CLIPS YOU WILL ONLY FIND HERE<br>Goals, top action, behind-the-scenes video, classic videos, unique footage of our players... Experience Bar\u00e7a like never before in short vertical videos!<br><br>STAY UP-TO-DATE WITH BAR\u00c7A STORIES<br>Keeping up to date at Bar\u00e7a has never been so easy. Follow Bar\u00e7a\u2019s day-to-day in real-time and dynamic Stories.<br><br>BE THE FIRST TO RECEIVE OFFICIAL NEWS<br>Everything is just gossip until you receive our official news. Make sure to turn push notifications on and you\u2019ll always be the most up-to-date person in the room.<br><br>SHARE YOUR OPINION WITH CULERS AROUND THE WORLD<br>Who has been the man of the match? Who do you think should start in the next game? Have your say and check out official club polls to see what other fans think.<br><br>TEST YOUR BAR\u00c7A KNOWLEDGE AND CHALLENGE FRIENDS<br>Do you think you know everything about Bar\u00e7a? Take part in our daily quizzes and prove you&#39;re the ultimate fan!<br><br>COMPETE AGAINST OTHER FANS<br>Show off your Bar\u00e7a expertise and climb to the top of the Match Day Challenge leaderboard by predicting the score, rating the game, and acing the match quizzes.<br><br>PREPARE YOURSELF FOR A VISIT<br>Whether it&#39;s tickets for the next match, a museum pass, or the latest kit you&#39;re after, you\u2019ll find it all in the online shop.<br><br>For\u00e7a Bar\u00e7a!",
